ho":"you","t":"10:22:36","text":"Printers are 2.4 only, fine. Scanners do 5. Turn steering back on and exclude the printer OUI."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:22:49","text":"Done. Steering on, printer OUI in the 2.4 only list."},{"who":"you","t":"10:22:57","text":"Note it in the change log so nobody flips it again."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:23:05","text":"Logged."},{"who":"you","t":"10:23:12","text":"Roam a scanner across the dock doors and watch the client page."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:23:22","text":"Walking it now. Hold on."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:23:48","text":"Roamed at -67, landed on 5 GHz, MCS 7 at the far door."},{"who":"you","t":"10:23:56","text":"Good. Still no drops on our call?"},{"who":"tech","t":"10:24:03","text":"None since the channel change."},{"who":"you","t":"10:24:12","text":"Pull the RF health graph for the ticket before it rolls off."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:24:25","text":"Exported. Also the break room is not on the map, it is behind the racks."},{"who":"you","t":"10:24:34","text":"Add it to the survey notes. That microwave is a permanent interferer."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:24:44","text":"Want a channel exclusion on 2.4 for that AP?"},{"who":"you","t":"10:24:53","text":"No. Let the RF management handle it now that steering is on. Watch it tomorrow."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:25:02","text":"Will do. Anything else while I am on the floor?"},{"who":"you","t":"10:25:11","text":"The mezzanine AP showed 3 dB lower Tx power in the audit. Check its port."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:25:31","text":"It is on a 15 W port. PoE budget again."},{"who":"you","t":"10:25:39","text":"Of course it is. Log it, we move it to a 30 W port on the refresh."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:25:48","text":"Logged. Heading back to the closet."},{"who":"you","t":"10:25:55","text":"Send me the screenshots and I will write it up."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:26:02","text":"On the way."},{"who":"you","t":"10:26:09","text":"Great call quality now, by the way."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:26:16","text":"Told you it was the microwave."},{"who":"you","t":"10:26:22","text":"You said warehouse AP."},{"who":"tech","t":"10:26:28","text":"I said it was the warehouse AP's problem."},{"who":"you","t":"10:26:35","text":"Sure you did."}],"sample":["","","",""],"fields":[[[0,2,"Frame Control","0x0801: type Data, To DS = 1 (client to AP)"],[2,2,"Duration","44 microseconds reserved for the ACK"],[4,6,"Address 1","receiver, the AP's BSSID 02:00:00:00:00:01"],[10,6,"Address 2","transmitter, the client 02:00:00:00:00:02"],[16,6,"Address 3","final destination 02:00:00:00:00:03, the wired side"],[22,2,"Sequence Control","sequence number 400, fragment 0"],[24,8,"LLC / SNAP","AA AA 03, OUI 00 00 00, EtherType 0x0800 = IPv4"],[32,20,"IPv4 header","192.0.2.10 to 203.0.113.40, TTL 64, protocol 6 = TCP"],[52,20,"TCP header","port 51234 to 443, PSH+ACK, the chat session to the Teams service"],[72,5,"TLS record header","0x17 application data, version 3.3, 96 bytes"],[77,8,"TLS nonce","explicit nonce for AES-GCM, counts up per record"],[85,72,"TLS ciphertext","the JSON message under AES-128-GCM; 72 bytes of noise without the key"],[157,16,"TLS auth tag","GCM tag; a flipped bit fails this before the app ever sees the message"],[173,4,"FCS","CRC-32 over everything before it"]],[[0,2,"Frame Control","0x0802: type Data, From DS = 1 (AP to client)"],[2,2,"Duration","44 microseconds reserved for the ACK"],[4,6,"Address 1","receiver, the client 02:00:00:00:00:02"],[10,6,"Address 2","transmitter, the AP's BSSID 02:00:00:00:00:01"],[16,6,"Address 3","original source 02:00:00:00:00:03, the wired side"],[22,2,"Sequence Control","sequence number 401, fragment 0"],[24,8,"LLC / SNAP","AA AA 03, OUI 00 00 00, EtherType 0x0800 = IPv4"],[32,20,"IPv4 header","203.0.113.40 to 192.0.2.10, TTL 64, protocol 6 = TCP"],[52,20,"TCP header","port 443 to 51234, PSH+ACK, the chat session to the Teams service"],[72,5,"TLS record header","0x17 application data, version 3.3, 98 bytes"],[77,8,"TLS nonce","explicit nonce for AES-GCM, co